        "custom_title": "Duo-Pil Standard Maxi Wax Warmer",
        "intro_highlight": "Engineered to support continuous multi-modality depilatory services in bustling aesthetic environments, the Duo-Pil Maxi integrates high-capacity thermal distribution with practitioner-focused spatial layout. Built strictly around advanced North American electrical safety standards, this specialized dual-chamber unit isolates thermal regulation so practicing specialists can maintain uninterrupted treatment workflows.",
        "custom_description": "<p>The Duo-Pil Maxi is purpose-built for practicing specialists, including Estheticians, Medical Spa Therapists, and Lash Technicians. Its ergonomic thermal regulation targets visual fatigue and postural strain during full 8-hour shifts, enabling sharper focus on technical precision and service consistency. Whether you are performing brow sculpting, deep-pore cleansing prep, or full-body hair removal, this professional station adjusts to your modality-specific positioning with instant-response calibration and intuitive one-hand control.</p>",
        "subtitle": "Advanced Dual Reservoir & Independent Regulation System",
        "secondary_description": "<p>Heavy-duty dependability is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the rapid heating efficiency and thermal precision of the Duo-Pil Maxi, daily surface wiping with a professional citrus-based solvent formulated for high-volume spa environments is recommended. The insulated stainless steel warming core resists harsh residue buildup, ensuring repeatable thermal output across years of rigorous commercial operation. Consistent care delivers service consistency and reduced downtime.</p>",
