          "settings": {
            "question": "Waxing Specialists:",
            "answer": "<p>High-volume Waxing Specialists managing packed daily schedules rely on the rapid heating profile of the Duo-Pil Maxi to eliminate client transition delays. By maintaining two distinct, highly stable thermal profiles across extended treatment shifts, the chassis prevents standard hard waxes and delicate soft waxes from crystalizing or scorching simultaneously, ensuring a smooth, predictable glide during delicate facial sculpting and full-body depilation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_74hYTC": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Clinical Spa Technicians:",
            "answer": "<p>For Clinical Spa Technicians incorporating depilatory prep into multi-modality body treatments, spatial optimization is critical. The insulated dual-tank footprint ($14.25\" \\times 9.5\" \\times 5\"H$) mounts securely onto mobile auxiliary carts without crowding sterilized field instrumentation. Its heavy-duty external casing remains cool to the touch, ensuring complete operator safety during tight maneuverability around primary aesthetic towers.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_bhzmwM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Salon Entrepreneurs:",
            "answer": "<p>Busy Salon Entrepreneurs benefit directly from the simultaneous 3 5/8-inch and 6-inch heating well configuration. This asymmetric setup allows staff to rapidly alternate between facial detail tins and bulk 42-ounce hard wax melting pots without needing multiple individual warmers, drastically reducing room turnover times between clients while maintaining strict compliance with state board sanitation mandates.</p>"
          }
        }
